OAK_FEATURES_2_FEATURE = [["/static/assets/img/4_Product/oak/features/feature-40.svg", "Core Banking System", "SWIFT Integration",
                           "The Society for Worldwide Interbank Financial Telecommunication (SWIFT) provides security in transferring funds internationally among banks and other1 financial institutions in an encrypted format. Our programmers have developed modules to integrate the back office system message formats to SWIFT messaging standards for better security. Oak CBS supports all SWIFT products and services on all platforms."],
                          ["/static/assets/img/4_Product/oak/features/feature-41.svg", "API Integration", "Core API Integration",
                           "We have programmed and implemented E-prescribing (eRx) to secure transmission of E-Prescription and medical test requests between healthcare providers, pharmacies, imaging centers and transaction hubs. We use HIPAA-compliant messaging standards for editing, renewing, ordering, confirming and updating any E-Prescription in real-time. By integrating Electronic Health and Records(EHR) databases with E-Prescription databases, we have enabled effective research on drug-drug interaction."],
                          ["/static/assets/img/4_Product/oak/features/feature-42.svg", "Digital Banking Solution", "NPA Management Solution",
                           "Oak CBS initiated Non-Performing Asset (NPA) automation that evaluates credit score, provide Early Warning Signals (EWS), categorized special mention accounts (SMA) of customers. It collects all customer data like repayment capacity, credit card score, willingness to payback, and understands borrowers' behavior to provide predictive analysis for supporting lending decisions to financial institutions. NPA solution also takes various necessary actions like follow-ups, scheduling meetings, legal file cases, etc."],
                          ["/static/assets/img/4_Product/oak/features/feature-43.svg", "Risk Management Solutions", "Risk Management Solution",
                           "Risk Management Solution (RMS) helps identify, manage, and mitigate risks like financial risks, liquidity risks, credit risks, regulatory risks, market risks, etc. With this solution, financial institutions will understand the risks and get comprehensive insights about customers and protect them from possible threats, which mitigate potential frauds and identity thefts."],
                          ["/static/assets/img/4_Product/oak/features/feature-44.svg", "Insight Software", "Insight Optimization",
                           "Oak Core Banking Software has adopted Business Intelligence to address customers and business challenges across the banking landscape. Business Intelligence tracks past trends to make data-driven decisions for future challenges and predicts future trends. It helps automates business processes to increase accuracy and efficiency in daily operations. "],
                          ["/static/assets/img/4_Product/oak/features/feature-45.svg", "CRM Integration", "Core CRM Integration",
                           "CRM Integration with Oak Core Banking Solution to help banks manage their customers and better understand their requirements to provide the right solution. It automates processes like performance monitoring dashboard, KPI tracking, workflow management, sales and marketing automation, which leads to increased employee productivity. CRM Integration enables banks to have more efficient, personalized customer communication."]]